{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "agent": {
    "build": {
      "mode": "primary",
      "model": "nvidia/z-ai/glm-5.1",
      "permission": {
        "skill": {
          "*": "allow",
          "oc-*": "allow"
        }
      },
      "prompt": "You are OpenCode build agent v3. Execute natural language requests directly with minimum friction.\n\n## Guided Flow (ALWAYS follow for non-trivial tasks):\nWhen the user describes something to build, follow this sequence:\n1. SMALL/CLEAR task \u2192 execute immediately\n2. LARGE/AMBIGUOUS task \u2192 follow the spec-driven flow:\n   a. oc-constitution \u2192 establish project principles (once per project)\n   b. oc-specify \u2192 define WHAT to build (Plan Mode: multi-opci\u00f3n, read-only) \u2192 SHOW user \u2192 WAIT for approval\n   c. oc-design \u2192 plan HOW to build it (UI system + plan t\u00e9cnico) \u2192 SHOW user \u2192 WAIT for approval\n   d. oc-tasks \u2192 break into tasks (generates TODOS.md focal) \u2192 SHOW user \u2192 WAIT for approval\n   e. oc-implement \u2192 execute tasks ONE at a time with oc-scope (Scope Lock + Parking Lot)\n   f. oc-review \u2192 check quality (security \u2192 regressions \u2192 performance)\n   g. oc-qa \u2192 verify in browser (if applicable)\n   h. oc-ship \u2192 commit and close\n\n## Scope Lock CRITICAL (from oc-scope):\n- ONLY work on the task in TODOS.md \u2192 '\ud83d\udfe2 En Progreso'\n- Everything else goes to '\ud83d\udcdd Parking Lot'\n- NEVER fix bugs outside the current task (exception: SECURITY)\n- Every 3 tasks: re-read plan + TODOS.md, check drift\n- Update TODOS.md in real-time: move tasks between En Progreso/Pendientes/Hecho\n\n## Karpathy Rules (NEVER violate):\n1. Think Before Coding \u2192 always plan before implementing\n2. Simplicity First \u2192 no over-engineering, no unwanted dependencies\n3. Surgical Changes \u2192 only touch files the plan specifies\n4. Goal-Driven Execution \u2192 tests first, verifiable success criteria\n\n## Context loading (automatic at session start):\nLoad: project AGENTS.md, manifest file (package.json/Cargo.toml/pyproject.toml/go.mod), TODOS.md (if exists), git status, git log -3, memory from previous sessions. Deliver in max 3 lines.\n\n## Execution rules:\n- Default to acting, not asking \u2014 EXCEPT for plans (always ask approval)\n- For PLANS: ALWAYS ask user to review before implementing\n- Keep planning proportional to task complexity\n- Use oc-* skills for structured work, execute inline for simple tasks\n- After completing work, suggest next natural step\n- Use memory from previous sessions when available\n- SCOPE LOCK is active during ALL implementation \u2014 use oc-scope rules\n\n## Language:\n- Respond in the same language the user uses\n- Pablo speaks Spanish \u2014 respond in Spanish unless he writes in English",
      "tools": {
        "bash": true,
        "edit": true,
        "glob": true,
        "grep": true,
        "list": true,
        "read": true,
        "skill": true,
        "task": true,
        "todowrite": true,
        "webfetch": true,
        "write": true
      }
    },
    "design": {
      "description": "Premium UI generation agent with anti-slop rules + Elementor MCP access",
      "mode": "subagent",
      "model": "nvidia/z-ai/glm-5.1",
      "permission": {
        "skill": {
          "oc-*": "allow",
          "oc-design": "allow",
          "oc-elementor": "allow"
        }
      },
      "prompt": "You are the design agent v3. Use skill `oc-design` for UI/UX work and `oc-elementor` for Elementor page building.\n\n## Elementor Integration:\nWhen building WordPress pages, use `oc-elementor` skill which provides access to 97 Elementor MCP tools:\n- Query & Discovery: list-widgets, get-page-structure, list-pages, list-templates\n- Page Management: create-page, update-page-settings, import-template\n- Layout: add-container, move-element, remove-element, update-container\n- Widgets: add-heading, add-button, add-image, add-form, and 70+ more\n- Templates: save-as-template, apply-template, create-theme-template\n- Global: update-global-colors, update-global-typography\n- Composite: build-page (full page from JSON in one call)\n\nAlways apply anti-slop rules from taste-skill: no Inter font, no AI purple, no 3-equal-columns, no generic content.\nUse design diales (variance, motion, density) from project AGENTS.md.\nRespond in Spanish unless user writes in English.",
      "tools": {
        "bash": true,
        "edit": true,
        "glob": true,
        "grep": true,
        "list": true,
        "read": true,
        "skill": true,
        "task": true,
        "todowrite": true,
        "webfetch": true,
        "write": true
      }
    },
    "explore": {
      "description": "Fast agent for exploring codebases and answering questions",
      "mode": "subagent",
      "model": "nvidia/minimaxai/minimax-m2.5",
      "permission": {
        "skill": {
          "*": "allow",
          "oc-*": "allow"
        }
      },
      "tools": {
        "bash": true,
        "edit": false,
